WEBVTT

00:00:07.573 --> 00:00:19.573
Turn the outlines into surfaces: select the side outline, Extrude along the normal both ways to cover the head's width; untick Create solid—we want surfaces

00:00:22.472 --> 00:00:34.472
Extrude the front outline the same way, covering the head's length

00:00:39.172 --> 00:00:47.753
The two surfaces cut through each other. Select both extrusions and click Section: their intersection curves

00:00:47.753 --> 00:00:59.640
Only the curves: the 3D edges of the head's shape, including the curved front-top corner—it lies in no single plane; it comes from intersecting two surfaces
